      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport torch\n\n\ndef standardize(rows):\n    x = torch.tensor(rows)\n    z = (x - x.mean(dim=0)) / x.std(dim=0, unbiased=False)\n    return [[round(v, 2) + 0.0 for v in row] for row in z.tolist()]\n\nfor row in standardize([[1.0, 10.0], [3.0, 30.0], [5.0, 20.0]]):\n    print(row)\n```"
